---
description: Push every published branch to Origin and GitHub
alwaysApply: true
---

After committing on this repo, push the same branch to both remotes:

```bash
./scripts/push-both.sh
```

That is `git push origin` (Cursor Origin) and `git push github` (https://github.com/Shashb21/synapse). Do not ship a change that exists on only one forge. Never commit `GH_TOKEN` or a PAT.
